WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:05.635 line:82% align:center
Welcome to PDRA, the Pre-Disaster Risk Assessment System of Gingoog City.

00:05.635 --> 00:09.190 line:82% align:center
Here's how to request an account.

00:09.240 --> 00:12.010 line:82% align:center
On the home page, click Request access.

00:12.060 --> 00:15.230 line:82% align:center
Type your full name.

00:15.280 --> 00:16.726 line:82% align:center
Enter your email address.

00:16.726 --> 00:19.730 line:82% align:center
Your username and password will be sent here.

00:19.780 --> 00:21.245 line:82% align:center
Enter your mobile number.

00:21.245 --> 00:24.750 line:82% align:center
It must have eleven digits, and start with zero nine.

00:24.800 --> 00:28.900 line:82% align:center
Choose your barangay from the list.

00:28.950 --> 00:34.090 line:82% align:center
Your position is optional, but it helps the CDRRMO confirm who you are.

00:34.140 --> 00:37.100 line:82% align:center
Check your details, then click Submit Request.

00:37.150 --> 00:37.812 line:82% align:center
That's it!

00:37.812 --> 00:40.195 line:82% align:center
The CDRRMO will review your request.

00:40.195 --> 00:46.590 line:82% align:center
Once it's approved, your login details will be emailed to you.
